     "intro": "クリスマスクッキー VR<br />\n<br />\n今年のクリスマスはちょっと早めに。<br />\nエルフの彼女が大好きなクッキーをプレゼント。<br />\n<br />\nVRで360度観覧!<br />\nOculus Rift、HTC Viveに対応。10分程度のVRミニアプリ。<br />\n<br />\n===<br />\nENGLISH<br />\n<br />\nChristmas comes early this year as you help this elven hottie bake some cookies. <br />\nThis is one elf you'll want to put on your shelf!<br />\n<br />\nPress the numeric keys to prepare the sweetest batch of cookies you've ever had!<br />\n<br />\nFor Oculus Rift and HTC Vive<br />\nAbout 10 min of entertainment"
    }
